bluejetty:00120305:ios.description:
Welcome to Baby Panda's Chinese Recipes! This is a cooking game about Chinese cuisine! In this cooking game, you can cook various delicious Chinese dishes according to the Chinese recipes from various restaurants! Become a good Chinese food chef through crazy cooking practice! Are you ready? Jump into our food game and begin your cooking adventure!
VARIOUS CHINESE RECIPES
You will find 14 kinds of delicious Chinese dishes in this cooking game. Apart from staples like noodles and dumplings, there are also specialties such as Peking duck and steamed fish, as well as festive delicacies such as sweet rice dumplings and zongzi, and traditional snacks like Chinese crepes and tanghulu, waiting for you to explore and cook. Come and create a kitchen story that is exclusively yours!
SIMPLE COOKING STEPS
In this cooking game, you are provided with a detailed recipe for each dish. Following the recipes and cooking tips from Baby Panda, you can chop, fry, deep-fry, and cook delicious Chinese dishes with just a few moves of your finger! Come and try it out!
LOVELY CUSTOMERS' FEEDBACK
Customers will give you surprising responses! It could be their happy face when they taste something delicious, or their fire-breathing mouth when they eat something spicy! By watching how customers respond in the restaurant, you can learn what they like and figure out if you’ve overcooked the food. Then, you can continue to explore new recipes and make the dishes that your customers will love even more!
In this cooking game, you can not only learn about Chinese food recipes but also gain traditional knowledge about Chinese food!
FEATURES:
- A Chinese food cooking game for kids;
- Various cooking recipes: 14 special Chinese dishes, such as dumplings and noodles;
- 14 Chinese traditional food restaurants to explore;
- Diverse ingredients: 40+ ingredients, such as apples, mushrooms, and lobsters;
- 6 ways of cooking: frying, boiling, stir-frying, instant boiling, steaming, and more;
- Kid-friendly designs: simple operation and step-by-step instructions;
- Customized food: make different flavors based on customers' preferences;
- Support offline play: play the cooking game offline anytime and anywhere!

